      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Balance is not discovered. It is enforced.”</em></p><p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): Justice (Arbiter).</strong> You are legitimacy under pressure: law, accountability, and the dangerous idea that consequences should actually mean something.</p><h3>Archetype Effects</h3><ul><li><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your archetype strengthens social order, reform, and conflict resolution. This Archetype is associated with <strong>+1 Diplomacy</strong> in faction calculus.</li><li><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for your full tactical and strategic toolkit.</li></ul>",
